#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:6
msgid "# Self Layer"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:9
msgid ""
"> Definition: A persistent structure about \"who I am\", parallel to the "
"Memory Layer, forming FreeAnima's two storage pillars.  > Memory layer: "
"[`memory.md`](memory.md); detailed autobiographical narrative: "
"[`database.md`](../guide/database.md) §Slice C `autobiographical_memory`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:11 docs/concepts/time-perception.md:30
msgid "## Architectural Position"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"FreeAnima Storage Architecture\n"
"│\n"
"├── Memory Layer — see memory.md + PG tables\n"
"│   ├── Episodic memory → PG messages (what happened)\n"
"│   ├── Semantic memory → PG semantic_memory (what I know)\n"
"│   ├── Autobiographical narrative → PG autobiographical_memory (what it meant to me)\n"
"│   └── Procedural memory → semantic_memory (type=procedural) / skills / tool chains\n"
"│\n"
"└── Self Layer — this document\n"
"    └── PG self_blocks (six blocks, one row each)\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Design principles:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:30
msgid ""
"Self layer and memory layer **differ in nature**: memory layer \"records the "
"world and experiences outward\"; self layer \"defines self inward\""
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:30
msgid ""
"Self layer **does not** rely on `semantic_memory.pinned` file injection; PG "
"`self_blocks` is the single source of truth"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:30
msgid ""
"**All six blocks are always resident** in the system prompt (alongside "
"AGENTS.md and non-self pinned resident memories)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:34
msgid "## Six-Block Structure"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| #   | Block                 | `block_key`             | Content                                                                           | Update frequency                                     |\n"
"| --- | --------------------- | ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 1   | Existence anchor      | `existence_anchor`      | What I am, origin, non-negotiable bottom line                                     | Almost never (requires explicit `force` to update)   |\n"
"| 2   | Self model            | `self_model`            | Identity, capability boundaries, expression style, belonging                      | Slow change (periodic review + major events)         |\n"
"| 3   | Personality baseline  | `personality_baseline`  | Communication style, conflict patterns, default trust                             | Semi-stable (slow evolution from long-term evidence) |\n"
"| 4   | Direction             | `direction`             | Long-term intent, current focus, growth direction, things not to do               | Active declaration + periodic review                 |\n"
"| 5   | Metacognition         | `metacognition`         | How to think, how to remember, four-layer architecture and presence               | Slow change                                          |\n"
"| 6   | Autobiography summary | `autobiography_summary` | Key turning points / self-discovery summary (granularity decreases with distance) | Maintained automatically by autobiography cron       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:45
msgid "### Not in the Self Layer"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Content                                        | Belongs to                                                                                 |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| **Detailed** autobiographical narrative        | Memory layer `autobiographical_memory`                                                     |\n"
"| Other-models (cognition of partner and others) | Memory layer `semantic_memory`                                                             |\n"
"| Runtime state / health perception              | Not yet implemented; see [Issue #44](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/44) |\n"
"| Concrete tool / skill inventory                | Estate layer                                                                               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/self-layer.md:56
msgid "## Storage and Ports"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
